 > [!important] MVP profile identity and sync boundary (2026-10-26)
 > The current MVP does not resolve a Cookbook packaging signature at Checkout. Consumer Cart fields form the configuration identity, OMS Order fields validate it post-order, and Delivery Catalog serves a local profile projection populated by Cookbook periodic sync and Kafka updates. If no usable Cookbook profile exists, the existing classification resolution is applied per line. Zipline Pack owns the provider-specific fit result.
 
