 ## Post-order Address Change — Current Product Direction
 
 For an allowed upstream physical-address change after order placement and before Zipline custody transfer, cancel the current Drone execution and switch directly to Ground, even if the new address remains Drone-eligible. Do not recreate a Drone Intent for the changed address. This supersedes both the earlier conditional fallback (only when the new address is ineligible) and the older cancel/re-Quote/recreate-Drone proposal.
